### 資產儀表板（要先在 auth.http 執行「登入」，accessToken 變數兩個檔案共用）

### 我的資產儀表板
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 新增現金帳戶
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "CASH", "name": "活存", "balance": 300000 }

### 新增負債
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "LIABILITY", "name": "信貸", "balance": 150000 }

### 新增或修改持股（同一檔再送一次就是修改）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets/holdings/2330
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shares": 1000, "averageCost": 950.5 }

### 刪除持股
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets/holdings/2330
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 刪除帳戶（id 換成上面回傳的帳戶 id；別人的帳戶 id 會回 404）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/members/me/assets/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
